OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be
OL,6,Fdry this evening with some patchy
OL,7,Fcloud and long clear spells. Remaining
OL,8,Fdry overnight with clear spell
OL,9,Fcontinuing. Winds falling light
OL,10,Fovernight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FIt will be a fine dry day with
OL,13,Fplenty of sunshine across Shetland. A
OL,14,Flittle cloudier over Orkney but still
OL,15,Flong sunny spells. Light to moderate
OL,16,Fsoutheasterly breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
